**Last Session Row:**
```vue
<div class="d-flex align-center gap-2 mb-6">
  <v-icon color="on-surface-3" size="16">mdi-history</v-icon>  <!-- use CSS var color -->
  <span class="fc-caption">{{ lastSessionLabel }}</span>
</div>
